{"id":"0c13b53e3c2977f7","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check.md","title":"有限项合一的出现检查","display":"thm-finite-term-occurs-check — 有限项合一的出现检查","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check","aliases":["72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check"],"display":"thm-finite-term-occurs-check — 有限项合一的出现检查","depends_on":["[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]]","[[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §2.5 print648/PDF660 and Ch.I §2.6 unification; complete local occurs-check proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-term-occurs-check — 有限项合一的出现检查"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00d14ca36dbe54df\" href=\"?note=00d14ca36dbe54df\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-term-size\">72-df-logic-program-term-size</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"03ecee8b72b25180\" href=\"?note=03ecee8b72b25180\" title=\"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier\">72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §2.5 print648/PDF660 and Ch.I §2.6 unification; complete local occurs-check proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T\">\\(t\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)\">\\(x\\in\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\ne x\">\\(t\\ne x\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。变量出现不包括绑定，因为项语言没有绑定者。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(x\\theta)&lt;\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(t\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(x\\theta)&lt;\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(t\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\operatorname{Unif}(\\{\\langle x,t\\rangle\\},\\theta),\\qquad\n\\{\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{Unif}(\\{\\langle x,t\\rangle\\},\\theta)\\}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\operatorname{Unif}(\\{\\langle x,t\\rangle\\},\\theta),\\qquad\n\\{\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{Unif}(\\{\\langle x,t\\rangle\\},\\theta)\\}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在t中沿一个x出现到根的路径，t≠x保证至少跨过一个函数根。同时代入把该叶换成xθ；每跨一个根，节点数严格增大，因为根贡献1，其他子树的大小非负。因此tθ的节点数严格大于xθ，不能字面相等。该结论依赖有限良基项树，不适用于允许循环或无限有理树的另一种统一语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-logic-program-term-size","status":"resolved","id":"00d14ca36dbe54df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier","status":"resolved","id":"03ecee8b72b25180","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"t\\ne x","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(x\\theta)<\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(t\\theta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\operatorname{Unif}(\\{\\langle x,t\\rangle\\},\\theta),\\qquad\n\\{\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{Unif}(\\{\\langle x,t\\rangle\\},\\theta)\\}=\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":1643,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]] · [[72-ex-cyclic-term-equation]] · [[72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution]] · [[72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch]] · [[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]] · [[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]] · [[72-ex-cyclic-term-equation]] · [[72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution]] · [[72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch]] · [[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]] · [[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check]]"},{"id":"32ddf86ddf0d947d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]] · [[72-ex-cyclic-term-equation]] · [[72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution]] · [[72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch]] · [[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]] · [[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check]]"}],"outgoing":["00d14ca36dbe54df","03ecee8b72b25180"]}